+A request being accepted is not proof that the external effect occurred.
+For an UNKNOWN or indeterminate external effect, the Verification Engine MUST
+request or consume reconciliation evidence from the external authority where
+possible and MUST NOT blindly retry an effect that could be duplicated.
+Reconciliation MUST use the stable action/idempotency identity and available
+evidence. UNKNOWN, FAILED, and INCONCLUSIVE results MUST NOT independently
+produce a successful outcome or authoritative World commit. Veda MUST NOT
+claim exactly-once external execution without a supporting external-system
+contract.
+
