+For a consequential transition, `parent_world_version`,
+`candidate_transition_hash`, the complete identified `evidence_set`, and
+`verification_policy_version` MUST be bound into the receipt. These bindings
+define the exact candidate and policy context to which the receipt applies.
+The receipt is a pre-commit verification artifact; it is not a
+`WORLD_COMMIT_RECEIPT` and does not independently authorize World commitment.
