+Verification events and receipts are pre-commit factual/historical records.
+They MUST NOT confer World Kernel authority, independently represent World
+commitment, or become post-commit successful outcome events. Chronicle
+preserves these records but does not own authoritative current World State.
+A successful outcome event MAY be issued only after the World Kernel atomic
+commit succeeds. Failed, rejected, stale, unknown, indeterminate and conflict
+paths MUST retain truthful durable evidence.
